{{!
    @template tool_vae/supersession_page

    The page "Fiches remplacées", below its heading: what the page is for, the error of a declaration refused, then the
    notification that no record is imported, or the table of the records followed by the heading and the form that declares
    a successor.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\supersession_page. The template holds no logic.
    Every text is escaped (double braces), except five keys of HTML (triple braces): errorhtml and nonehtml, notifications
    made by the core ($output->notification(), the message of an error escaped); tablehtml, a table drawn by the template
    tool_vae/table (its codes and dates escaped by the template tool_vae/cell_content, the labels formatted by
    format_string(), the buttons made by the core); headinghtml, a heading of the core ($output->heading()); formhtml, the
    form of the core (moodleform::render()), drawn once.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * intro - string, what the page is for
    * errorhtml - false, or HTML: the error of a declaration refused
    * nonehtml - false, or HTML: the notification that no record is imported
    * tablehtml - false, or HTML: the table of the records
    * headinghtml - false, or HTML: the heading above the form
    * formhtml - false, or HTML: the form that declares a successor

    Example context (json):
    {
        "intro": "When a certification record is republished under a new number, say here which record replaces which.",
        "errorhtml": false,
        "nonehtml": false,
        "tablehtml": "<table class=\"generaltable\"><tbody><tr><td>DEMO-GRAND-AGE</td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "headinghtml": "<h3>Declare a successor</h3>",
        "formhtml": "<form method=\"post\" action=\"https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/supersession.php\"></form>"
    }
}}
<p>{{intro}}</p>
{{#errorhtml}}
{{{errorhtml}}}
{{/errorhtml}}
{{#nonehtml}}
{{{nonehtml}}}
{{/nonehtml}}
{{#tablehtml}}
{{{tablehtml}}}
{{/tablehtml}}
{{#headinghtml}}
{{{headinghtml}}}
{{/headinghtml}}
{{#formhtml}}
{{{formhtml}}}
{{/formhtml}}
